{
 "duration": 27.897,
 "lines": [
  {
   "text": "Lily bought a cheap water-resistant jacket for a rainy fall hike.",
   "start": 0.3,
   "end": 4.071
  },
  {
   "text": "An hour in, the shoulders soaked through, and she was damp inside from sweat too.",
   "start": 4.271,
   "end": 8.683
  },
  {
   "text": "Here's how to choose a waterproof hiking jacket.",
   "start": 9.033,
   "end": 11.434
  },
  {
   "text": "Waterproof means taped seams and a membrane that keeps rain out.",
   "start": 11.734,
   "end": 15.469
  },
  {
   "text": "Breathable means sweat vapor can escape, so open the vents when you climb.",
   "start": 15.669,
   "end": 19.918
  },
  {
   "text": "Water-resistant only handles a light drizzle.",
   "start": 20.118,
   "end": 22.832
  },
  {
   "text": "Lily's new shell kept her dry all day.",
   "start": 23.232,
   "end": 25.371
  },
  {
   "text": "Save this before your next rainy hike.",
   "start": 25.771,
   "end": 27.697
  }
 ],
